#: ../../source/docs/common-gcs-only-operation.rst:5
#: db48a0ecdc8b468697e69b9182ec8eff
msgid "Operation Using Only a Ground Control Station (GCS)"
msgstr "仅使用地面站（GCS）操作"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gcs-only-operation.rst:7
#: 7127c4188ee249359ebf1671cbbe325e
msgid ""
"While it is generally recommended that a Radio Control system is employed as"
" primary pilot control means for ArduPilot vehicles, it is not a "
"requirement. It is possible to operate a vehicle using only a Ground Control"
" Station (GCS), with or without joystick input. Setup varies vehicle to "
"vehicle, and is detailed below."
msgstr ""
"虽然通常建议将遥控系统作为 ArduPilot "
"飞行器的主要操控方式，但这并非强制要求。可以仅使用地面站（GCS）操控飞行器，有无摇杆均可。具体设置因飞行器而异，详见下文。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gcs-only-operation.rst:11
#: 0bc1109b92214a5a982f65131753289e
msgid "Capability"
msgstr "功能"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gcs-only-operation.rst:13
#: 0531830f9130442b8a1e74c7cd31ad20
msgid ""
"If a joystick is connected to the GCS, then almost the same control "
"capabilities are available as with a radio control transmitter/receiver. "
"Mode changes can be assigned to joystick buttons. If an RC transmitter is "
"used as the joystick, then the same control precision can be obtained. Use "
"of low resolution , cheaper \"game\" style joysticks will usually provide a "
"less than enjoyable experience and use of high quality joystick or use of an"
" RC transmitter as a joystick (OpenTX provides this capability) is highly "
"recommended."
msgstr ""
"如果摇杆连接到 "
"GCS，则几乎具备与遥控器相同的控制能力。模式切换可分配给摇杆按钮。如果使用遥控器作为摇杆，则可获得相同的控制精度。使用低分辨率、廉价「游戏」风格摇杆通常会带来较差的体验，强烈建议使用高质量摇杆或将遥控器用作摇杆（OpenTX"
" 提供此功能）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gcs-only-operation.rst:15
#: bdf7c1acd77a438ba524305be9af8c91
msgid ""
"It is also possible to use only the GCS itself, if only autonomous missions "
"or guided mode operation is desired."
msgstr "如果只需要自主任务或 Guided 模式操作，也可以仅使用 GCS 本身。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gcs-only-operation.rst:18
#: 8138198c7b334458b07e3b8f15d9373c
msgid "Failsafes"
msgstr "失控保护"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gcs-only-operation.rst:20
#: 69a7e6c87e4045629a3a6606b162c4d8
msgid ""
"It is highly recommended that the GCS failsafe be setup for the vehicle, "
"since GCS connectivity is being relied upon exclusively for vehicle control."
" See :ref:`apms-failsafe-function`, :ref:`Copter Failsafe <failsafe-landing-"
"page>`, or :ref:`Rover Failsafes <rover-failsafes>`, as appropriate."
msgstr ""
"强烈建议为飞行器设置 GCS 失控保护，因为 GCS 连接是飞行器控制的唯一依赖。详见 :ref:`apms-failsafe-"
"function`、:ref:`Copter Failsafe <failsafe-landing-page>` 或 :ref:`Rover "
"Failsafes <rover-failsafes>`（视情况而定）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gcs-only-operation.rst:22
#: 2a4b13af008c4b8cb7a9cdfeb7f035f3
msgid ""
"RC failsafe can also be used if a joystick is being used to send RC "
"information (RC_OVERRIDES) via MAVLink. If the joystick fails or is "
"disconnected, and normal :ref:`radio-failsafe` will occur."
msgstr ""
"如果使用摇杆通过 MAVLink 发送 RC 信息（RC_OVERRIDES），也可以使用 RC 失控保护。如果摇杆故障或断开连接，将触发正常的 "
":ref:`radio-failsafe`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gcs-only-operation.rst:24
#: f92c9bde5377410cbe9b4f2dc8cea3d9
msgid ""
"Of course, other failsafes can be setup and utilized as desired in addition "
"to the GCS failsafe."
msgstr "当然，除 GCS 失控保护外，还可以根据需要设置和使用其他失控保护。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gcs-only-operation.rst:27
#: d194d17398834a829f26098c28057d55
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gcs-only-operation.rst:30
#: d1d1ea4267914927a7f413e823518568
msgid "Plane and Rover"
msgstr "固定翼和 Rover"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gcs-only-operation.rst:32
#: cacbd0c82d884c2ea4aec432192b3bff
msgid ""
"Both Plane and Rover only require two parameter changes to allow the arming "
"of the vehicle when using only a GCS."
msgstr "固定翼和 Rover 仅需更改两个参数，即可在仅使用 GCS 时解锁飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gcs-only-operation.rst:34
#: 553f8ce14d9a4d55b8ee0ca350e63ab3
msgid ""
"If you are NOT using a joystick to provide RC overrides via MAVLink, or you "
"do not want a failsafe if the joystick fails, then in Plane, "
":ref:`THR_FAILSAFE<THR_FAILSAFE>` must be set to zero, while in Rover, "
":ref:`FS_THR_ENABLE<FS_THR_ENABLE>` must be set to zero."
msgstr ""
"如果不使用摇杆通过 MAVLink 提供 RC 覆盖，或不希望在摇杆故障时触发失控保护，则固定翼中 "
":ref:`THR_FAILSAFE<THR_FAILSAFE>` 必须设为零，Rover 中 "
":ref:`FS_THR_ENABLE<FS_THR_ENABLE>` 必须设为零。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gcs-only-operation.rst:35
#: a306bf916a6941a88836655164a8e56f
msgid ""
"In both Plane and Rover, :ref:`RC_PROTOCOLs<RC_PROTOCOLs>` should be set to "
"\"0\" to prevent accidental detection of noise as an RC source."
msgstr ""
"固定翼和 Rover 中，:ref:`RC_PROTOCOLs<RC_PROTOCOLs>` 应设为「0」，以防止将噪声误识别为 RC 源。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gcs-only-operation.rst:37
#: 1abe4eba640043369639c675732e27f7
msgid ""
"The vehicle can then be armed after the GPS has obtained lock and internal "
"initializations have been completed, either by joystick rudder arming (if "
"enabled, see :ref:`ARMING_RUDDER<ARMING_RUDDER>` ) or arming command from "
"the GCS."
msgstr ""
"GPS 获锁且内部初始化完成后，可通过摇杆方向舵解锁（如已启用，见 :ref:`ARMING_RUDDER<ARMING_RUDDER>`）或 GCS "
"解锁命令来解锁飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gcs-only-operation.rst:41
#: b76a86c5ed5a431f9380b550a99fb5ba
msgid "Copter"
msgstr "Copter"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gcs-only-operation.rst:43
#: 3cc19e7343f94aa3ba6069d1078eb2bf
msgid ""
"Copter has a few additional safety checks that must be accommodated in order"
" to arm with no RC input."
msgstr "Copter 有几项额外的安全检查，必须满足才能在无 RC 输入的情况下解锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gcs-only-operation.rst:45
#: 671da4141b6b48129cc9cbef6cf0681b
msgid ""
":ref:`FS_THR_ENABLE<FS_THR_ENABLE>` must be set to zero if no joystick is "
"being used or you do not want a failsafe if the joystick fails or is "
"disabled."
msgstr ""
"如果不使用摇杆或不希望在摇杆故障或禁用时触发失控保护，则 :ref:`FS_THR_ENABLE<FS_THR_ENABLE>` 必须设为零。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gcs-only-operation.rst:46
#: dac88e7308094e4589393df1daf017f9
msgid ""
":ref:`ARMING_CHECK<ARMING_CHECK>` should not include bit 6 (RC check). A "
"value of 65470 will include all other checks. It is not recommended that "
":ref:`ARMING_CHECK<ARMING_CHECK>` set for 0 (ARM immediately), since "
"important system checks would be bypassed."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ARMING_CHECK<ARMING_CHECK>` 不应包含第 6 位（RC 检查）。值 65470 将包含所有其他检查。不建议将 "
":ref:`ARMING_CHECK<ARMING_CHECK>` 设为 0（立即解锁），因为这将绕过重要的系统检查。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gcs-only-operation.rst:47
#: 15aec6af56d84738acf48b4d7d21b6ce
msgid ""
"assuming that the :ref:`RCMAP_ROLL <RCMAP_ROLL>`, :ref:`RCMAP_PITCH "
"<RCMAP_PITCH>`, :ref:`RCMAP_THROTTLE <RCMAP_THROTTLE>` and :ref:`RCMAP_YAW "
"<RCMAP_YAW>` parameters are default, then the RC 1 thru 4 channels' maximum "
"and minimum parameters must be changed slightly. This is because Copter "
"checks to see that the RC calibration has been done. But since no RC is used"
" in the system, this step will not have occurred. Therefore, to emulate that"
" this has happened, the min and max values need to be changed from their "
"defaults of 1100 and 1900, respectively. Values of 1101 and 1901, will do "
"for the ``RCx_MIN`` and ``RCx_MAX`` for the roll,pitch, throttle, and yaw RC"
" channels."
msgstr ""
"假设 :ref:`RCMAP_ROLL <RCMAP_ROLL>`、:ref:`RCMAP_PITCH "
"<RCMAP_PITCH>`、:ref:`RCMAP_THROTTLE <RCMAP_THROTTLE>` 和 :ref:`RCMAP_YAW "
"<RCMAP_YAW>` 参数为默认值，则 RC 1 至 4 通道的最大值和最小值参数需要略作更改。这是因为 Copter 会检查 RC "
"校准是否已完成。但由于系统中不使用 RC，此步骤不会发生。因此，为了模拟已完成校准，横滚、俯仰、油门和偏航 RC 通道的 ``RCx_MIN`` 和 "
"``RCx_MAX`` 最小值和最大值需从默认的 1100 和 1900 分别改为 1101 和 1901。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gcs-only-operation.rst:49
#: 9d2238ce860f4a73936f433b9fb8ca18
msgid ""
"The vehicle can then be armed after the GPS has obtained lock and internal "
"initializations have completed, either by joystick rudder arming (if "
"enabled, see :ref:`ARMING_RUDDER<ARMING_RUDDER>` ) or arming command from "
"the GCS."
msgstr ""
"GPS 获锁且内部初始化完成后，可通过摇杆方向舵解锁（如已启用，见 :ref:`ARMING_RUDDER<ARMING_RUDDER>`）或 GCS "
"解锁命令来解锁飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gcs-only-operation.rst:51
#: 93d3318fd8834389a31cedcad276a810
msgid ""
"However, there is still one more safety check that needs to be cleared. "
"Copter will auto-disarm after a few seconds if the throttle is not raised "
"above idle. If a joystick is used, this is easily accomplished. However, if "
"AUTO or GUIDED operation without a joystick is desired, then after arming, a"
" MISSION START command must be issued in AUTO mode, as shown below for "
"Mission Planner, or a TAKEOFF command be issued from the GCS (in Mission "
"Planner, this is a mouse right button click option) within a few seconds of "
"arming. QGC has a slider button that will arm and start the mission in one "
"swipe."
msgstr ""
"但是，还有最后一项安全检查需要通过。如果油门未提升到怠速以上，Copter "
"将在几秒后自动上锁。如果使用摇杆，这很容易实现。但如果希望在无摇杆的情况下进行 Auto 或 Guided 操作，则在解锁后必须在 Auto 模式下发出"
" MISSION START 命令（如下图 Mission Planner 所示），或在解锁后几秒内从 GCS 发出 TAKEOFF 命令（在 "
"Mission Planner 中，这是鼠标右键单击选项）。QGC 有一个滑动按钮，可在一次滑动中完成解锁并开始任务。"
